    "updated_at": "2022-10-26T14:34:58Z",
    "body": "I think deprecated/warning is appropriate for this API. That's why it's labeled `// legacy` in Web IDL. Also, it sounds like you are relying on https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#getting-the-current-value-of-the-event-handler which is what is used for event handler content attributes, you wouldn't be accessing the global getter in that case. Perhaps some tooling doesn't understand how event handlers work in HTML?",
